<title>USA: AMRE says Century 21 relationship strong.</title>
<headline>AMRE says Century 21 relationship strong.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMRE Inc and Century 21 Real Estate Corp said that, despite recent market rumors, the relationship between the two companies remained strong.</p>
<p>AMRE Inc, which is the parent company of Century 21 Home Improvements Inc, licenses the brand name under a 20-year exclusive license agreement with Century 21 Real Estate Corp and TM Acquisition Corp, both subsidiaries of HFS Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
